menuconfig BLUFI_PROVISIONING_ENABLED
    bool "BluFi (BLE) WiFi provisioning"
    default y
    select BT_ENABLED
    select BT_NIMBLE_BLUFI_ENABLE
    help
        Enables the BluFi (BLE) provisioning component (NimBLE host), usable
        from the EspBlufi mobile app or the BlufiEsp32WeChat WeChat mini-program
        (https://github.com/xuhongv/BlufiEsp32WeChat).

        Enabling this pulls in the NimBLE (BLE-only) stack, which reserves about
        40 KB of SRAM for the lifetime of the firmware while BLE is up.
        Set it to "n" to strip BLE entirely and reclaim that memory.
